    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_metallic_ores; processing_state=raw_ore): Ore/concentrate heading (chromite / chromate of iron in tons; metal 'contained in ore, matte, regulus'; pyrites); belongs with Metallic Ores & Concentrates like its sibling headings. Layer-1 observations: 7 rows, 1895–1901. Series: CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×6. Units: Ounces ×6; Lbs. (Pounds) ×1. Top routes: Canada → United States ×3; Canada → All Countries ×2; British Columbia → All Countries ×1; Ontario → All Countries ×1."@en ;
